  "description": "Estimate the carbon emissions of web pages with Website Carbon's keyless API, from Wholegrain Digital (the service behind websitecarbon.com). Turn a page's weight and its hosting into the CO2e a visit costs, its Digital Carbon Rating from A+ to F, and the yearly footprint at real traffic; compare pages against each other, weigh up green hosting, size up a file download or a month of CDN traffic, and fail a build when a page goes over its carbon budget. No account or API key required.",
  "display_name": "Website Carbon",
  "id": "website_carbon"
}
